{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52202","headline":"颂六十二首 二十七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贤人轨玄度，弱丧升虚迁。\n师通资自发，神光照有缘。\n应变各殊别，圣录同灵篇。\n乘乾因九五，逸响亮三千。\n法鼓振玄教，龙飞应人天。\n恬智冥微妙，缥𦕈咏重玄\n磐纡七七纪，嘉运莅中旛。\n挺此四八姿，映蔚华林园。\n（见同书卷三四《见解篇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}